- error shake.
- panel grid 2 columns.
- toggle cards: display flex; .on styles with cyan border/glow; switch.
- mod-switch like toggle-row i but cyan/orange. Use orange for active? Theme: cyan for mods. Use `--cyan`.
- sliders styling.
- actions.
